        "Description": "Change of plans 47. Kalvin Ritter has vital information on potential future targets and must be kept alive. However, the captain of the boat, Robert R. White, and his second in command, Lukas Fnullman, have devised their own plan to kill him in an attempt to get their hands on his art collection. Take them out along with Finlay Blackburn, a mechanic tampering with the engine; Reginald Gibson, a guard outside Ritter&apos;s office waiting to kill him; and Michael Carter, who&apos;s guarding the helicopter.",
